      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 30,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "They found an Egyptian in the field, and brought him to David, and gave him bread, and he ate; and they gave him water to drink.",
      "ko": "무리가 들에서 애굽 사람 하나를 만나 다윗에게로 데려다가 떡을 주어 먹게 하며 물을 마시우고",
      "source_text_hash": "7c0ebc3d9e1de4b6b986fc673d525c78bbf61510676d748724505ece3504d7e3",
      "translation_text_hash": "fdaf6761fe4edf169aad24c75251eae08cf97b6877cb1ce448a4ac82dd617a80",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
