      ],
      "en": "We made a raid on the South of the Cherethites, and on that which belongs to Judah, and on the South of Caleb; and we burned Ziklag with fire.”",
      "ko": "우리가 그렛 사람의 남방과 유다에 속한 지방과 갈멜 남방을 침로하고 시글락을 불살랐나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "0dd7ecd0a7c1b7ce654571f928c8b9d831ee7eb4ae044d3b08757ad2451cd120",
      "translation_text_hash": "ebe8b9a2a4d6cb634cecc2e55a49bb63cff993344bb52915760f1d44ce01de93",
